      "created_at": "2015-01-22T16:21:58.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>But he can! &nbsp;Not with one Haka of Battle, but you can draw your entire deck, discard it HoB, reshuffle and draw it again, discard it to another HoB, and repeat until he has a +999999 to damage.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Admittedly, doing so requires&nbsp;<em>a lot</em> of setup but it is technically possible.</p>",
