      "created_at": "2015-01-23T05:10:44.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Shouldn't Parse be able to ruin Gloomweaver's day by throwing all his relics in the trash with just Extrasensory Awareness?</p><p>With enough setup time, Parse can also hit for staggering amounts of damage by way of multiple Critical Multipliers and repeated discard effects (Recompile, Gauge, Snap Decision, Segmentation Fault).</p><p>Super Scientific Tachyon could also toss all of Gloomy's relics for him, but it'd take a lot more luck for her to pull it off.</p>",
